# Raw and derived recordings stay local (~15 GB). Only the small, shareable artifacts are
# committed: the Task 5 checkpoints (data/task5_runs, about 145 MB, no file over 4 MB), the
# first Task 5 model's per-trial predictions (data/task5_predictions, about 37 MB), the
# kinematics, and the READMEs and manifests that describe the data folders.
/data/export_outputs/
/data/features/
/data/parrm_outputs/
/data/semi_synthetic/
/data/semisynthetic/

# Model checkpoints are large binaries; result CSVs in task3_results/ are committed.
*.pt
!data/task5_runs/**/*.pt

# Course handout (kept locally, not part of the code)
EECS-182-Project-Overview.pdf

# Virtual environment (recreate with: python -m venv .venv, then pip install -r requirements.txt)
.venv
.venv/

# Python
__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS junk
__MACOSX/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# kaggle bundle (hardlinked data, rebuilt by kaggle/build_dataset.py)
kaggle/dataset/
kaggle/kernel/
kaggle/out/
task4_2_run/

# Writeups, figures and generated reports stay local (LaTeX sources, PDFs, plots, diagrams).
/reports/
/docs/

# Legacy local artifacts from the earlier baseline runs (parquet scores, tables, figures).
/results/

# Local-only dataset notes, superseded by docs/ (also local).
/Notes.md
/EECS182_file_map_261117.md
